#: ../../source/docs/autotrim.rst:5 371d0f37e1734a459f6c29ce52e0ed8c
msgid "AutoTrim"
msgstr "AutoTrim"

#: ../../source/docs/autotrim.rst:7 86b61c530aea4a7bb251d4cd6796e132
msgid ""
"Wind of course has a strong effect on your copter and will push it around. "
"However you may also find that while flying in stabilize mode, even in a "
"windless environment your copter tends to always drift away in the same "
"direction. This can largely be corrected using the \"Save Trim\" or "
"\"Automatic Trim\" functions."
msgstr ""
"风当然对飞行器有很大影响，会将其推来推去。但您可能还会发现，即使在无风环境中以Stabilize模式飞行，飞行器也总是朝同一方向漂移。这主要可以通过\"保存微调\"或\"自动微调\"功能来纠正。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotrim.rst:11 dde3e2919d4543b3a073ed19409dcd37
msgid ""
"For most users this procedure is not necessary because the "
":ref:`accelerometer calibration <common-accelerometer-calibration>` does a "
"good job of setting the trim values."
msgstr ""
"对于大多数用户来说，此过程并不必要，因为 :ref:`加速度计校准 <common-accelerometer-calibration>` "
"已能很好地设置微调值。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotrim.rst:14 43b2c0a4d5b84e4586c1ed41b68deabc
msgid "AHRS AutoTrim"
msgstr "AHRS 自动配平"

#: ../../source/docs/autotrim.rst:16 f9b543ae655f4e61b41abeeee43f0c9f
msgid ""
"With AHRS AutoTrim the roll and pitch corrections are captured as you fly in"
" a stable hover. Setup a :ref:`common-auxiliary-functions` switch to \"In "
"Flight AHRS trim adjust\" (\"182\"). We will use CH7 in the following:"
msgstr ""
"使用 AHRS AutoTrim 时，横滚和俯仰的修正量会在稳定悬停飞行中被捕获。将一个 :ref:`common-auxiliary-"
"functions` 开关设置为 \"In Flight AHRS trim adjust\"（\"182\"）。下文将使用 CH7："

#: ../../source/docs/autotrim.rst:18 ../../source/docs/autotrim.rst:51
#: e3c49cb5fa0d45a597e009511de6110c ffe0ae10cb894c09a792e4e614044de1
msgid ""
"Check that your CH7 switch goes above 1800 on the MissionPlanner's Setup > "
"Mandatory Hardware > Radio Calibration screen"
msgstr ""
"在 Mission Planner 的 Setup > Mandatory Hardware > Radio Calibration 界面检查 CH7 "
"开关是否超过 1800"

#: ../../source/docs/autotrim.rst:23 58e6d28fde5f46e9b92714f616c641a6
msgid ""
"Set the CH7 Option to \"AHRS AutoTrim\" on the Software > Copter Pids screen"
" and press the \"Write Params\" button."
msgstr ""
"在 Software > Copter Pids 界面将 CH7 选项设为 \"AHRS AutoTrim\"，并按 \"Write Params\" "
"按钮。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotrim.rst:25 a3ad5c5b00e6471691e813e00ed2666a
msgid ""
"Find a wind free environment with sufficient space to fly your copter "
"without crashing into something."
msgstr "找一个无风、且有足够空间飞行飞行器而不会撞到东西的环境。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotrim.rst:27 7b60c193e1454a4981c7b94831c9b137
msgid ""
"Put the vehicle in manual Stabilize/AltHold mode or a position hold "
"Loiter/PosHold mode (recommended)."
msgstr "将飞行器置于手动的 Stabilize/AltHold 模式，或位置保持的 Loiter/PosHold 模式（推荐）。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotrim.rst:29 f3aa1b4cbea44d61889127fffb934270
msgid ""
"Arm the vehicle and lift into a hover. The vehicle must be flying in order "
"to enable autotrim. Flip the switch that you setup (CH7) to its High "
"position (>1800us). \"Autotrim running\" message will be sent to the GCS."
msgstr ""
"解锁飞行器并升空悬停。飞行器必须处于飞行状态才能启用 autotrim。将你设置的开关（CH7）拨到高位（>1800us）。\"Autotrim "
"running\" 消息将发送到 GCS。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotrim.rst:31 2648624821e14b148ac0df7cd9a31086
msgid ""
"If in a manual mode, fly your copter for about 25 seconds in a stable hover "
"in position, keeping it from drifting with the pitch and roll sticks. As the"
" trim is adjusted, less and less corrections with the sticks will be "
"required. If using a position hold mode, take off and let the copter hover "
"in place while not touching the sticks."
msgstr ""
"如果处于手动模式，让飞行器在原地稳定悬停约 25 "
"秒，并用俯仰和横滚摇杆防止其漂移。随着微调被逐步修正，所需的摇杆修正会越来越少。如果使用位置保持模式，起飞后让飞行器原地悬停，不要触碰摇杆。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotrim.rst:33 5ce3dd379af64c51a739ecacfa183c68
msgid ""
"Once satisfied, flip the switch low, saving the trims, and land. \"Trim "
"save\" message will be sent to the GCS."
msgstr "满意后，将开关拨到低位以保存微调量，然后降落。\"Trim save\" 消息将发送到 GCS。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotrim.rst:35 e8547e07254848ba8e90cd67ad3ff616
msgid ""
"Take off in AltHold mode and check if your copter is flying level now. If "
"not repeat steps 4 - 7 again."
msgstr "在 AltHold 模式下起飞，检查飞行器现在是否水平飞行。如果不是，重复步骤 4 - 7。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotrim.rst:39 1de749d905274e129b5f089b41c404b3
msgid ""
"You can manually set the trim by modifying the :ref:`AHRS_TRIM_X "
"<AHRS_TRIM_X>` and :ref:`AHRS_TRIM_Y <AHRS_TRIM_Y>`. Roll trim is "
":ref:`AHRS_TRIM_X <AHRS_TRIM_X>`, Pitch trim is :ref:`AHRS_TRIM_Y "
"<AHRS_TRIM_Y>`. Both values are in radians with left roll and forward pitch "
"being negative numbers."
msgstr ""
"您可以通过修改 :ref:`AHRS_TRIM_X <AHRS_TRIM_X>` 和 :ref:`AHRS_TRIM_Y <AHRS_TRIM_Y>` "
"手动设置微调。横滚微调为 :ref:`AHRS_TRIM_X <AHRS_TRIM_X>`，俯仰微调为 :ref:`AHRS_TRIM_Y "
"<AHRS_TRIM_Y>`。两个值均以弧度表示，向左横滚和向前俯仰为负数。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotrim.rst:43 00fe9c4fadc14a4ea6ca2323d552ab3a
msgid ""
"It is nearly impossible to get rid of all drift so that your copter remains "
"completely motionless without any input. It may be preferable to yaw the "
"copter 90 degrees and holding that orientation for about 6-7 seconds each "
"time so that any external disturbances will get cancelled out, resulting in "
"a better trim."
msgstr ""
"几乎不可能消除所有漂移，使飞行器在没有任何输入时完全静止。更好的做法是将飞行器偏航 90 度，并每次保持该朝向约 6-7 "
"秒，从而抵消外部扰动，获得更好的微调结果。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotrim.rst:46 e51e89494d474232b0bd0170556ef5ad
msgid "Save Trim"
msgstr "保存微调"

#: ../../source/docs/autotrim.rst:47 cb97d1a854b243c39d3020f3bc3a6c85
msgid ""
"the above AHRS AutoTrim method is preferred since it does not involve moving"
" transmitter trims after RC calibration."
msgstr "上述 AHRS AutoTrim 方法更为可取，因为它不需要在 RC 校准后移动遥控器的微调。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotrim.rst:49 a501f260c46a454ebf30469a60f060ee
msgid ""
"Save trim involves essentially transferring your radio transmitter's trims "
"into the autopilot's AHRS trim (the :ref:`AHRS_TRIM_X <AHRS_TRIM_X>` and "
":ref:`AHRS_TRIM_Y <AHRS_TRIM_Y>` parameters), the same values that the AHRS "
"AutoTrim method above adjusts. Normally, once :ref:`common-accelerometer-"
"calibration` is done, you never want to change the transmitter's trims, but "
"in this case it is done **temporarily**. The \"Save Trim\" function (\"5\") "
"is assigned to any free RC channel, usually a switch based one, using an "
":ref:`common-auxiliary-functions`. For the example below, Channel 7 will be "
"used."
msgstr ""
"Save trim 实质上是把遥控器的微调量转移到飞控的 AHRS 微调（即 :ref:`AHRS_TRIM_X <AHRS_TRIM_X>` 和 "
":ref:`AHRS_TRIM_Y <AHRS_TRIM_Y>` 参数）中，也就是上文 AHRS AutoTrim 方法所调整的那些数值。通常在完成 "
":ref:`common-accelerometer-calibration` 后，绝不应再更改遥控器的微调，但此处只是 **临时** "
"这么做。\"Save Trim\" 功能（\"5\"）通过 :ref:`common-auxiliary-functions` 分配到任意空闲的 RC "
"通道，通常是开关类通道。下例将使用通道 7。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotrim.rst:56 67eb60a6fc764be793bdcd738863422a
msgid ""
"Set the RC7 Option to Save Trim in the Config > Extended Tuning screen and "
"press the \"Write Params\" button"
msgstr "在 Config > Extended Tuning 界面将 RC7 选项设为 Save Trim，并按 \"Write Params\" 按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/autotrim.rst:61 4fbd89bd48684dbdb394354eab0689d7
msgid ""
"With your CH7 switch in the off (Low) position, fly your copter in Stabilize"
" mode and use your transmitters's roll and pitch trim to get it flying level"
msgstr "将 CH7 开关置于关闭（低）位置，在 Stabilize 模式下飞行，使用遥控器的横滚和俯仰微调使其水平飞行"

#: ../../source/docs/autotrim.rst:63 fedc84c235ef4394b9a070f14c9e5c90
msgid "Land and put your throttle to zero"
msgstr "降落并将油门降至零。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotrim.rst:65 46160802cca942d982af3adcd394283b
msgid ""
"Release the roll and pitch sticks and switch the CH7 switch high for at "
"least 1 second.  The words \"Trim saved\" should appear in the MP's Flight "
"Data screen's Messages tab"
msgstr "松开横滚和俯仰摇杆，将CH7开关拨高至少1秒。MP飞行数据界面的消息标签应出现\"Trim saved\"字样。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotrim.rst:67 a85411b1f0fb4c199bb9e0ea5b76196a
msgid ""
"Reset your transmitters roll and pitch trims back to the center and fly "
"again and it should fly level now. If it does not repeat steps 3, 4 & 5"
msgstr "将遥控器的横滚和俯仰微调重置回中心，再次飞行，现在应该能水平飞行了。如果不行，重复步骤3、4、5。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotrim.rst:70 4a19bf9eea26460ba46b5b8f9182f472
msgid "Desktop method"
msgstr "桌面方法"

#: ../../source/docs/autotrim.rst:72 04b0e3f40ef2432c8012b737025d4241
msgid ""
"The trim can also be updated by setting the vehicle level, connecting to the"
" Mission Planner (or perhaps other ground stations) and selecting Initial "
"Setup, Mandatory Hardware, Accel Calibration and pushing the lower "
"\"Calibrate Level\" button."
msgstr ""
"也可以通过将飞行器放平、连接Mission Planner（或其他地面站）并选择Initial Setup、Mandatory "
"Hardware、Accel Calibration，然后按下方的\"Calibrate Level\"按钮来更新微调。"

#: ../../source/docs/autotrim.rst:80 7b1c3aa927a44cfeb2cd849f71f81791
msgid ""
"Please note though that making the HUD level while the vehicle is on the "
"ground does not necessarily mean it won't drift horizontally while flying "
"because of other small frame issues including the flight controller not "
"being perfectly level on the frame, CG placement, an/ord slightly tilted "
"motors."
msgstr ""
"但请注意，在地面上使 HUD 水平并不一定意味着飞行时不会水平漂移，因为还有其他小的机架问题，包括飞控在机架上未完全水平、重心位置、以及电机略有倾斜。"

